      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_1100_rival_05a",
      "hash64": "744F60BE419B3F3D",
      "text": "Irgendwie hat es ja schon was Antikes an sich.\\nDas klingt echt plausibel![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
